  "content": "[Intro 1]\n[Db5]  [Eb5]\n[F5]\n[Db5]\n[Eb5]\n[Bb/D]  [Db5]  [Eb5]\n[F5]\n[Db5]\n[Eb5]\n[Bb/D]  [Db5]  [Eb5]\n[F5]\n[Db5]\n[Eb5]\n[Bb/D]  [Db5]  [Eb5]\n\n[Intro 2]\n[F5]\n[Db5]\n[Eb5]\n[Bb/D]  [Db5]  [Eb5]\n[F5]\n[Db5]\n[Eb5]\n[Bb/D]  [Db5]  [Eb5]\n[F5]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Fm7]Since the\nday that you were born\n[Fm6]The\nwheels are in motion\n[Fm7]Turning\neven faster\n[Fm6]Play your part\nin the big machine\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Fm]The stage is set\n[C/E]The road is chosen\n[Fm/D#]Your fate\n[Bb/D]preordained\n[Bbm]We are watching you\n[Abdim7]\n[C]Every step of the way\n[Db5]\n[C5]\n\n[Chorus]\n[F5]Never too late\n[Db5]To stand your ground\n[Eb5]Revoi-\n[Bb/D]lution [Eb5][Db5]begins\n[F5]In\n[Db5]you In\n[Eb5]me Revo-\n[Bb/D]lution! [Db5][Eb5]\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Fm7]Once lost\nLost in their game\n[Fm6]Mental chains\nBreaking now\n[Fm7]\nSet yourself free\n[Fm6]Who are they to\ntell you what to do?\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[Fm]The stage is not set\n[C/E]The road is not chosen\n[Fm/D#]You fate not\n[Bb/D]preordained\n[Bbm]They are losing con-\n[Abdim7]trol\n[C]Every step of the\nway\n\n[Chorus]\n[F5]Never too late\n[Db5]To stand your ground\n[Eb5]Revoi-\n[Bb/D]lution [Eb5][Db5]begins\n[F5]In\n[Db5]you In\n[Eb5]me Revo-\n[Bb/D]lution! [Db5][Eb5]\n\n[Solo 1]\n[Ebm]\n[Daug]\n[Ebm/Db]\n[Ab/C]\n[Abm]\n[F/A]\n[Bb]\n\n[Solo 2]\n[B]\n[Db]\n[Gb]  [Db/F]\n[Ebm]  [Db]\n[B]\n[Ab/C]\n[Db]\n[Bb/D]\n[Ebm]\n\n[Bridge]\n[C5]\n\n[Intrelude]\n[Eb5]\n[B5]\n[Db5]\n[Ab/C]\n\n[Chorus]\n[F5]Never too late\n[Db5]To stand your ground\n[Eb5]Revoi-\n[Bb/D]lution [Eb5][Db5]begins\n[F5]In\n[Db5]you In\n[Eb5]me\n[Bb/D]This is [Db5]Revolution! [Eb5]\n\n[Outro]\n[F5]\n[Db5]\n[Eb5]Revo-\n[Bb/D]lution! [Db5][Eb5]\n[F5]\n[Db5]\n[Eb5]\n[Bb/D]  [Db5]  [Eb5]\n[F5]",
